---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Image from 'astro/components/Image.astro'

---

<Layout title="About Us">
    <div class="relative">
        <img src="/images/shipping-and-importing-header.jpg" alt="About Us Header" class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover"/>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 flex items-center justify-center">
            <h1 class="text-white text-5xl font-light">About Us</h1>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[#b42026] -mt-12">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] min-h-[500px] flex items-center px-8">
            <p class="text-white text-2xl font-light text-center leading-relaxed">
                Solomon Industries LLC provides high-quality stone products to brighten up your kitchen space. Committed to creating innovative solutions, we transform your kitchen into a warm and upscale environment where families can enjoy delicious meals and create memorable experiences.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 py-12">
        <h2 class="text-[#b42026] text-4xl font-bold uppercase mb-6">Core Values</h2>
        <p class="text-[#b42026] text-2xl font-light mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            With a vision for the future and a commitment to continuous improvement, we are dedicated to consistently providing quartz products with the highest level of dedication and quality to our customers.
        </p>

        <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8"/>

        <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <h3 class="text-[#b42026] text-2xl">Innovation</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-4 md:pl-[72px]">
                    <p class="text-[#b42026] text-xl font-light">
                        We are always seeking new and innovative solutions to meet the needs of our customers. We encourage creativity and are willing to push the boundaries to deliver cutting-edge natural stone products.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="border-gray-200"/>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <h3 class="text-[#b42026] text-2xl">Quality</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-4 md:pl-[72px]">
                    <p class="text-[#b42026] text-xl font-light">
                        Quality and reliability are our core principles. We are committed to providing high-quality natural stone products and services, ensuring maximum performance and dependability in every project.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="border-gray-200"/>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <h3 class="text-[#b42026] text-2xl">Consulting</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-4 md:pl-[72px]">
                    <p class="text-[#b42026] text-xl font-light">
                        We are dedicated to listening to our customers and understanding their needs. We not only provide natural stone products, but also act as trusted consultants, helping customers choose the most suitable solutions.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="border-gray-200"/>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <h3 class="text-[#b42026] text-2xl">Sustainability</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-4 md:pl-[72px]">
                    <p class="text-[#b42026] text-xl font-light">
                        We are committed to promoting the use of sustainable materials to make a positive contribution to environmental protection. We aim to build a sustainable future and help minimize the negative impact on the planet through our natural stone products.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="border-gray-200"/>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <h3 class="text-[#b42026] text-2xl">Partnership</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-4 md:pl-[72px]">
                    <p class="text-[#b42026] text-xl font-light">
                        We believe that success comes from close cooperation and building long-term relationships with customers, partners, and the community. We prioritize these relationships above all in the context of our natural stone offerings.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
